+## SERIOUS — recovery scans have no usable indexes
+
+Expired attempts need a partial index by lease expiry.
+
+Terminalizing submissions need a partial index by terminalizing time.
+
+Both exact indexes are given in A3.
+
+Without them, every recovery tick scans durable history.
