+## SERIOUS — runnable-head lookup is not covered in queue order
+
+**Slow query**
+
+```sql
+select * from submissions s
+where s.tenant_id = $1
+  and s.workspace_id = $2
+  and s.session_id = $3
+  and s.status <> 'settled'
+order by s.queue_seq
+limit 1;
